 <h3>Intercropping Meta-Analysis App</h3>\n    <p>Explore a global meta-analysis of intercropping experiments with map, time-series, and crop-pair views,\n    plus a PCA on land-equivalent ratios to see what drives yield gains and input reductions.</p>\n    <div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag land\">Intercropping</span><span class=\"tag\">Shiny</span><span class=\"tag\">PCA</span></div>\n    <div class=\"card-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/jacksoncoldiron/shiny_intercropping_jc_nd_ig\"><i class=\"bi bi-github\"></i> Code</a>\n      <!-- EDIT: add <a href=\"https://...shinyapps.io/...\">Live app</a> if deployed -->\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"jc-card lift\">\n    <div class=\"card-meta\">Python · Remote sensing · 2025–26</div>\n    <h3>SIF, Irrigation &amp; Drought</h3>\n    <p>OCO-2 solar-induced fluorescence and Cropland Data Layer analysis of seasonal cycles, diurnal patterns, and\n    drought impacts in agricultural areas, the starting point for the irrigation-buffering study.</p>\n    <div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag water\">SIF</span><span class=\"tag\">xarray</span><span class=\"tag\">rasterio</span><span class=\"tag\">Jupyter</span></div>\n    <div class=\"card-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/jacksoncoldiron/SIF-Analysis\"><i class=\"bi bi-github\"></i> Code</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"jc-card lift\">\n    <div class=\"card-meta\">R · Arnhold Fellowship · 2025–26</div>\n    <h3>Multifunctional Landscapes (SPARCLE)</h3>\n    <p>Raster harmonization and multi-criteria suitability pipeline for agroforestry and agrivoltaics across\n    Sub-Saharan Africa at 1 km, under SSP1-2.6 and SSP3-7.0.</p>\n    <div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag land\">Agroforestry</span><span class=\"tag sand\">Agrivoltaics</span><span class=\"tag\">terra</span><span class=\"tag\">Earth Engine</span></div>\n    <div class=\"card-links\"><span class=\"private\"><i class=\"bi bi-lock\"></i> Private until publication</span></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"jc-card lift\">\n    <div class=\"card-meta\">R · ArcGIS Pro · 2025–26</div>\n    <h3>IPLC Climate Nexus: Amazonia</h3>\n    <p>Group project with Conservation International mapping climate risk across Indigenous and local community\n    territories and prioritizing lands for conservation and restoration.</p>\n    <div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag land\">Amazonia</span><span class=\"tag\">prioritizr</span><span class=\"tag\">ArcGIS Pro</span></div>\n    <div class=\"card-links\"><span class=\"private\"><i class=\"bi bi-lock\"></i> Group repository (private)</span></div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"margin-top:3rem\">Geospatial analyses</div>\n<h2 class=\"section-title\">Smaller studies &amp; coursework</h2>\n<div class=\"card-grid\">\n\n  <a class=\"jc-card\" href=\"https://github.com/jacksoncoldiron/aquaculture-suitability-analysis\">\n    <div class=\"card-meta\">R · Marine spatial planning</div>\n    <h3>West Coast Aquaculture Suitability</h3>\n    <p>Which West Coast EEZs suit Pacific oysters and giant kelp, based on sea-surface temperature and depth,\n    with a San Francisco Bay case study.</p>\n    <div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag water\">Ocean</span><span class=\"tag\">terra</span></div>\n  </a>\n\n  <a class=\"jc-card\" href=\"https://github.com/jacksoncoldiron/Texas-WinterStorm-Blackout-Analysis\">\n    <div class=\"card-meta\">R · Night lights</div>\n    <h3>Texas Winter Storm Blackouts</h3>\n    <p>VIIRS night lights, OpenStreetMap, and census data to find which Houston homes lost power in the February\n    2021 storm and whether outages fell harder on lower-income areas.</p>\n    <div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag\">VIIRS</span><span class=\"tag\">sf · stars</span></div>\n  </a>\n\n  <a class=\"jc-card\" href=\"https://github.com/jacksoncoldiron/Redlining-EJ-LosAngeles\">\n    <div class=\"card-meta\">R · Environmental justice</div>\n    <h3>Redlining &amp; Environmental Justice in LA</h